&lt;p&gt;At JetBrains, code is our passion. Ever since we started, back in 2000, we have been striving to make the strongest, most effective developer tools on earth. By automating routine checks and corrections, our tools speed up production, freeing developers to grow, discover, and create.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are now looking for a Senior Legal Counsel – Employment Law, based in Germany, to provide expert legal support on German employment law and contribute to employment-related matters across JetBrains’ global operations. The role involves supporting HR in managing sensitive workplace situations, contributing to the development and implementation of employment practices that align with legal standards and business needs, and advising on employee representation structures.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a trusted advisor to HR&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;on sensitive and complex employee matters, providing strategic guidance that takes into account legal requirements, organizational context, and reputational considerations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;strategic legal support and pragmatic counsel to the Group Counsel – Labor Law, General Counsel, and the HR team, with a primary focus on German labor law and broader support across JetBrains’ operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handle a wide range of employee matters, including complex and sensitive cases in Germany, and assist with such matters in other jurisdictions by developing sound legal strategies, reviewing documentation, and helping the business confidently stand behind its decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assess and respond to complex or nuanced internal communications and reports, supporting the development of thoughtful and well-balanced strategies aligned with legal and organizational considerations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Draft, review, and continuously improve employment agreements, contractor agreements, and HR-related templates and policies tailored to Germany and other applicable jurisdictions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct in-depth, group-wide analyses on employment and labor law topics, and lead or contribute to cross-functional projects, including the harmonization of employment policies and documentation across countries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a senior advisor to HR teams on employment practices and workplace policies, including remote work, employee benefits, disciplinary procedures, and work safety matters, particularly for the German entities of the JetBrains group.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take a lead role in providing legal support in relation to employee representation structures with a focus on Germany.&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Advise on their operations and management interactions in compliance with local legislation and best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay abreast of legislative changes in German labor law and provide legal training and knowledge-sharing sessions to internal stakeholders, particularly HR and management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent JetBrains in communications with German regulatory and government bodies on employment-related matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with legal colleagues across the global team on projects and issues that intersect with employment and labor law.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in German and English, both written and spoken.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A law degree with excellent academic credentials. German bar admission is an advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Senior-level post-qualification experience in employment and labor law, typically gained through 6+ years of relevant legal practice with demonstrated hands-on experience in employment dispute resolution. Experience in both in-house and reputable international law firm environments is an advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-depth knowledge of German employment law, with practical experience advising on complex workplace matters, procedures, and collaboration with employee representation structures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to provide clear, solutions-oriented guidance in complex or evolving legal contexts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to assess sensitive employee-related matters, distill key issues, and develop clear, effective legal and communication approaches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent skills in legal drafting, negotiation, dispute resolution, and managing emotionally sensitive situations involving employees.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive, collaborative, pragmatic, and adaptable solutions-oriented approach, with strong interpersonal skills and business awareness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to work independently in a fast-paced, international environment with multiple stakeholders and shifting priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to provide support for employment law matters in other countries with the help of external counsel and internal legal colleagues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join JetBrains?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong base salary. We offer competitive pay that reflects your skills and experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible work location. Enjoy the freedom to work from home or from the office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remote work. Spend up to 30 days per year working remotely from abroad.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extra time off. More days to relax, recharge, and do the things you love.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Medical insurance allowance. Enjoy peace of mind for you and your family&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning and development opportunities. Access to conferences, courses, and language classes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Language classes. Pick up the local language or sharpen your English skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fuel your day. Enjoy a hot meal or receive a lunch allowance on workdays.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental health support. To help you feel your best, we provide easy access to professional mental health services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sports benefit. Enjoy an on-site gym or sports club stipend.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Internal events. Join company-wide celebrations and team gatherings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*Some benefits may vary depending on location.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#LI-HYBRID&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#LI-MH1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We know great ideas can come from anyone, anywhere. That’s why we do our best to create an open and inclusive workplace – one that welcomes everyone regardless of their background, identity, religion, age, accessibility needs, or orientation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;We process the data provided in your job application in accordance with the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.jetbrains.com/legal/docs/privacy/privacy-recruitment/&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt; Find  Jobs in Germany  on Arbeitnow

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At HelloFresh, we want to change the way people eat forever by making it easier for customers around the world to discover, plan, and enjoy high-quality meals. Over the past decade, we’ve grown from a meal-kit company into a global food solutions group, active across multiple brands including HelloFresh, Factor, Green Chef, EveryPlate, Chef’s Plate, and Youfoodz.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As search behavior evolves across Google, AI Overviews, ChatGPT, Perplexity, Reddit, and other discovery surfaces, our SEO team is expanding its focus from traditional organic search to broader Organic Discovery: building the content, technical, authority, and measurement foundations that help customers find our brands wherever discovery and dinner decisions happen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Team Lead, SEO &amp;amp; GEO&lt;/strong&gt; to lead our global Organic Discovery team and help shape the next phase of how HelloFresh Group approaches organic growth. This role will lead a team of SEO/GEO specialists and work across international markets to translate global strategy into scalable programs that grow non-brand organic demand, strengthen our visibility across traditional and AI-driven search, and improve the quality and discoverability of our content.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a highly cross-functional leadership role. You will partner closely with Product, Engineering, Analytics, Content, Brand, and local Marketing teams to identify opportunities, prioritize the highest-impact work, and build scalable solutions across brands and markets. You’ll need to be equally comfortable setting strategy, coaching a team, digging into performance data, and influencing senior stakeholders to move complex initiatives forward.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, coach, and develop a team of SEO/GEO specialists, setting clear priorities and creating an environment of strong ownership, collaboration, and continuous development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help define and execute the global SEO &amp;amp; GEO strategy across HelloFresh Group brands and markets, translating broader Organic Discovery priorities into actionable roadmaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to grow non-brand organic demand and customer acquisition across traditional search engines, AI search experiences, and emerging discovery platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with local Marketing teams to understand market-specific opportunities and challenges while building global strategies, standards, and solutions that can scale across markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead cross-functional Organic Discovery initiatives spanning technical SEO, content strategy, on-page optimization, structured data, internal linking, authority and trust signals, and GEO/AI visibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Product and Engineering to translate SEO/GEO opportunities into clear requirements, influence roadmap prioritization, and ensure Organic Discovery is considered in all major product and platform decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop scalable approaches to content creation, optimization, and governance across recipe, editorial, transactional, and other high-value organic surfaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advance our GEO strategy by identifying how our brands can become more visible, cited, and authoritative across AI-powered discovery experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use search, analytics, AI visibility, competitive, and internal business data to identify opportunities, diagnose performance changes, prioritize investments, and measure impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish clear performance reporting and communicate SEO/GEO performance, opportunities, risks, and recommendations to senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support global and local teams with SEO/GEO expertise, creating frameworks and best practices that enable markets to move quickly without sacrificing quality or consistency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage relationships with relevant agencies, technology partners, and vendors where appropriate, ensuring external resources are aligned to our strategy and delivering measurable value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay ahead of changes in search behavior, search engine platforms, generative AI, and the broader discovery ecosystem, translating emerging trends into practical implications for HelloFresh Group.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of experience in SEO / Organic Growth, ideally within large-scale, international, consumer-facing websites.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience leading and developing SEO or Organic Growth teams, with the ability to balance people leadership with hands-on strategic involvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Broad SEO expertise spanning technical SEO, content strategy, on-page optimization, authority, international SEO, and performance measurement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of how AI-powered search and answer engines are changing organic discovery, with curiosity and practical experience applying GEO/AEO principles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing strategies and roadmaps across multiple markets, brands, or business units and balancing global scalability with local-market needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ability to partner with Product and Engineering teams, translate organic growth opportunities into clear requirements, and influence prioritization without direct authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills and experience using platforms such as Google Search Console, GA4, Ahrefs, Profound, Screaming Frog, or similar SEO, analytics, and AI-visibility tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to connect SEO/GEO performance to broader business outcomes and clearly communicate priorities, tradeoffs, and recommendations to senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent stakeholder management and communication skills, with experience navigating complex, cross-functional organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High ownership, strong judgment, and comfort operating in an evolving environment where priorities, technologies, and customer discovery behaviors are changing quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elevate your lifestyle! Join one of Europe&#39;s fastest-growing tech powerhouses in a dynamic phase of expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Immerse yourself in a diverse global community of 90+ nationalities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy a competitive compensation package that goes beyond the norm, with perks like a HelloFresh- subsidized Pension Scheme, Berlin relocation support, and a Hybrid working model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elevate your lifestyle with exclusive discounts on your weekly HelloFresh box and office meals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Invest in your growth with an annual learning &amp;amp; development budget, German language learning budget, and access to the HelloFresh Academy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plus, we&#39;ve got your well-being covered with mental health support, transportation perks, and working-parent-friendly benefits. From our 24/7 gym access, and wellbeing platforms like Headspace and Spill. HelloFresh is not just a workplace; it&#39;s a lifestyle of perks and possibilities!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you up for the challenge?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Please submit your complete application below including your salary expectations and earliest starting date.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;After submitting an application our team will review this and get back to you within 5 business days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt; Find  Jobs in Germany  on Arbeitnow

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HelloFresh is going AI-first. Join us in leading the shift and shaping the global customer experience. As a Senior UX Strategist &amp;amp; Researcher on our UX team, you&#39;ll own work from ambiguous brief to strategic outcome and implementation — defining project needs, using innovative research approaches, prototyping direction instead of presenting findings, and walking into executive meetings with a decision artifact, not a summary. The most valued teammates today aren&#39;t the ones who run the most studies. They shape which questions get asked, challenge business assumptions before money is spent, and stay in the room to drive the decision.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll use AI fluently as a genuine creative and strategic partner throughout the product design lifecycle. Strategy and research are your deepest strengths, but you’ll also work across the wider UX practice. We’re looking for people who go deep in one area and can take interface design, service design, and content to a solid minimum quality standard on their own, using AI to move fast, and who know when a problem needs a specialist’s depth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Above all, we are looking for people who will&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;make HelloFresh&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;better.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We believe there are many different ways of developing skills and we love diverse experiences! So even if you don’t “tick all the boxes” but think you’d thrive in this role, we would really like to learn more about you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead strategic research for insights to action: &lt;/strong&gt;Own the end-to-end research and strategy work streams, from scoping through execution to insight delivery and application, balancing primary, secondary, qualitative and quantitative methods.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape experiences across the ecosystem: &lt;/strong&gt;Partner with product, design, marketing, operations, and business teams to understand and shape experiences across the full customer and service ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape the agenda, not just respond to it: &lt;/strong&gt;Proactively identify which bets need de-risking before anyone has asked. Challenge briefs before executing them. Connect findings to business decisions, market context, and KPIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Influence at strategic altitude:&lt;/strong&gt; influence decision-makers— often VP/SVP — presenting in formats that force a decision in the room, not a follow-up meeting. Build visual directions, opportunity frameworks, and concept artifacts that make choices tangible.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design and lead workshops:&lt;/strong&gt; Own co-creation and alignment sessions end-to-end — the room, the agenda, and the output. Move teams from findings to direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make insight visible:&lt;/strong&gt; Build prototypes, concept visualizations, and service scenarios — using AI where needed to close the gap between insight and expression.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Apply the right method for the moment:&lt;/strong&gt; Select methods based on what the problem demands, not what&#39;s most familiar. Apply foundational, generative, or evaluative methodologies, rightsized to the context and the level of speed and rigor required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work AI-native across strategy and research: &lt;/strong&gt;Apply AI from framing the problem and scoping studies through analysis, synthesis, and strategic recommendations. Use it to prototype directions and create decision-informed content, turning findings into executive-ready narratives and visual frameworks that compress the insight-to-action cycle. Experiment with novel methods, bring what works into live projects, and apply critical judgment throughout, knowing when to override the model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Break down barriers across UX: &lt;/strong&gt;Use AI to flex into interface design, service design, and content, producing work that meets a clear minimum quality bar on your own, and knowing when a problem needs a specialist’s depth. Help the team do the same by sharing what works, so AI removes execution barriers between disciplines and scales across the UX organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years in UX research, UX strategy, Service Design or a closely related field within a product or tech environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mixed-methods toolkit with strong judgment for when to apply which approach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience influencing VP/SVP-level stakeholders — changing decisions, not just informing them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to design and lead workshops and co-creation sessions with cross-functional teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to prototype and visualize strategic direction independently — through concept sketches, lo-fi prototypes, service blueprints, or AI-assisted artifacts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong strategic storytelling and visual communication; deliverables built to move people, not just inform them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuine AI native workflows and outputs in a research or strategy context — demonstrated point of view on how AI should change our workflows and where its limits are, as well as practical experience applying AI in real project contexts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business acumen: able to connect research to trade-offs, market context, and commercial implications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Depth plus breadth: Deep strategy and research skills, plus working knowledge of interface design, service design, and content craft. You can produce work that meets a defined quality bar with AI support, and you’re comfortable handing off when the depth required goes beyond that.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elevate your lifestyle! Join one of Europe&#39;s fastest-growing tech powerhouses in a dynamic phase of expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Immerse yourself in a diverse global community of 90+ nationalities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy a competitive compensation package that goes beyond the norm, with perks like a HelloFresh- subsidized Pension Scheme, Berlin relocation support, and a Hybrid working model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elevate your lifestyle with exclusive discounts on your weekly HelloFresh box and office meals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Invest in your growth with a German language learning budget, and access to the HelloFresh Academy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plus, we&#39;ve got your well-being covered with mental health support, transportation perks, and working-parent-friendly benefits. From our 24/7 gym access,wellbeing platforms like Headspace and Spill, to sabbatical leave options, HelloFresh is not just a workplace; it&#39;s a lifestyle of perks and possibilities!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#UX #DESIGN #RESEARCH&lt;/p&gt; Find  Jobs in Germany  on Arbeitnow

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The (Senior) Category Manager Marketing will be responsible for overseeing strategic sourcing and contracting at HelloFresh for Marketing across different marketing categories, which may include: Offline Media, Online Media, Influencer Marketing, Sponsorships, Retail Media, etc. The goal is to collaborate seamlessly with Global and regional stakeholders and major suppliers in all HelloFresh markets and help them to navigate the procurement landscape. In addition, the role will be supporting initiatives targeted to increase the maturity level of Indirect Procurement’s processes and systems landscape. As part of the Marketing&amp;nbsp; Procurement team the position will report to the respective lead based in Berlin.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an entrepreneurial, confident, proactive and high-spirited Procurement professional with a strength for prioritisation, data handling and great stakeholder management.&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Above all, we are looking for people who will &lt;strong&gt;make HelloFresh&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;better.&lt;/strong&gt; We believe there are many different ways of developing skills and we love diverse experiences! So even if you don’t “tick all the boxes” but think you’d thrive in this role, we would really like to learn more about you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own end-to-end Marketing sourcing: supplier market mapping, RFx execution, negotiation, and contract award for high-value projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop category strategies for different marketing categories, in alignment with the business’ goals&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create, align and execute a sourcing roadmap with key stakeholders in the HQ and the regional markets to deliver P&amp;amp;L savings and overall procurement value&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and optimize the supplier portfolio across Hello Fresh’s markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cultivate and manage close relationships with (senior) business partners within Marketing to support their objectives and the company growth agenda&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the implementation of best-in-class procurement processes and tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum 5+ years experience in Marketing procurement or in Marketing with a commercial focus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep knowledge of strategic sourcing methodology, category management, and supplier management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent analytical skills, attention to detail, and drive to working independently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of taking ownership: identifying problems early and driving resolution independently, without waiting to be directed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills, including preparing and delivering presentations and reports for senior audience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent interpersonal skills with proven ability to build trust and credibility with business partners at different levels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to work in a fast-moving entrepreneurial environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent Business English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
