&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Define and execute the growth strategy across the customer base, covering upsell, cross-sell, renewals, and churn prevention from highly automated mid-market motions to high-touch enterprise relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Own top-of-funnel pipeline generation by leading the BDR team, with targets aligned across the Sales Director, enterprise Account Executives, and Marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Drive the adoption of AI and automation across customer touchpoints, renewals, expansion triggers, and prospecting, working closely with Product, Ops, and agent builders to test, measure, and scale what works.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Champion the voice of the customer by translating insights into product feedback that shapes the Mirakl Connect roadmap, while building a team culture grounded in ownership, experimentation, and results.&lt;/li&gt;
